Z||000166||Gold-86SE||09-20-2000||10:22 AM||||<BR>Granted, I have not take the 14 hours necessary to read thru 5 pages of posts, but I have one question.<P>Why is it that we get squabbles of issues like this?<P>One guy trys one thing - it worked.  One guy tries another thing - it worked.  Sometimes there is more than one way to skin a cat.  <BR>And myself as a watcher of a thread, may not always respond to that thread, but seeing two or more points regarding an issue, sometimes,  can be very beneficial when diagnosing my problems.<P>Just my $0.02.<BR><P>------------------<BR>Gold-86SE (Fiero Collector)||||reg||1
