Z||000172||LarryB||09-27-2000||09:11 PM||||That sounds like you've got a small leak, after 5-10 minutes of driving does the clutch feel soft? Can you build up pressure again for a while by pressing and releasing the clutch 3-4 times as fast as you can?  Have you bled the clutch to get all the air out, have the problem come back the next day, and bleed the system only to find more air bubbles?<P>||||reg||1
